Package: airautomatica
Version: 0.1.0
Section: misc
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: python3 (>= 3.12), python3-venv, python3-pip, ffmpeg
Maintainer: AirAutomatica <https://github.com/StobyWan/AirAutomatica>
Description: MAVLink telemetry companion app for Raspberry Pi
 Companion computer app that reads MAVLink telemetry from ArduPilot,
 maintains shared aircraft state, and exposes a local FastAPI server.
 Designed for Raspberry Pi 5 with optional AI HAT+.
 .
 Runs as a systemd service. Default: mock mode (no FC/serial/Ollama required).
 Configure via /etc/airautomatica/airautomatica.env
